    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST AND CHALLENGING ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, teleport, and move forward. Challenge yourself by dashing at the speed of light through all types of mazes in this Arcade game. Your precision and speed will be put to test.\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIABOLICAL DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPEEDRUNNER, THIS IS YOUR PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and other players. Each level has its own leaderboard. Can you make it to the top score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE RIGHTS PERKS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 50 handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Incremental difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Leaderboards for each level and mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Random elements and orientations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Roguelite/infinite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Improve your times on each level and compete against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enhanced input response for better control feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Electronic music that adapts to the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed, lots of speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Have we mentioned that the game is made with a lot of love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Extremely fun.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST AND CHALLENGING ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, teleport, and move forward. Challenge yourself by dashing at the speed of light through all types of mazes in this Arcade game. Your precision and speed will be put to test.\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/ebb8f9bb749518be44c3977d4469c9a0.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIABOLICAL DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/d51eaf94a8e17256bb25be1d76237d7a.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPEEDRUNNER, THIS IS YOUR PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and other players. Each level has its own leaderboard. Can you make it to the top score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/a4418f42d1b4d3b6bf0167974b76a65f.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE RIGHTS PERKS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.poster.avif?t=1752740883\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.webm?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204230/extras/16670a253c13653cf045db4013516742.mp4?t=1752740883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 50 handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Incremental difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Leaderboards for each level and mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Random elements and orientations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Roguelite/infinite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Improve your times on each level and compete against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enhanced input response for better control feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Electronic music that adapts to the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed, lots of speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Have we mentioned that the game is made with a lot of love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Extremely fun.</p>",
